{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Hack and Slash, Mystery Dungeon&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an adventurer and challenge the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is randomly generated and changes shape every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may encounter monsters in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with monsters are turn-based, and monsters don't move until you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up treasure chests scattered throughout the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests can also be dropped by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be able to get rare items on deeper floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals to escape from the dungeon will appear at certain floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you return to your base, update equipment, acquire skills, and venture deeper floors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997030?t=1760915702","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997030?t=1760915702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997030/1d9d041290be871e4c5b1c892b49e0f64144719c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760915702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997030/1d9d041290be871e4c5b1c892b49e0f64144719c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760915702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Hack and Slash, Mystery Dungeon&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an adventurer and challenge the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is randomly generated and changes shape every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may encounter monsters in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with monsters are turn-based, and monsters don't move until you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up treasure chests scattered throughout the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests can also be dropped by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be able to get rare items on deeper floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portals to escape from the dungeon will appear at certain floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you return to your base, update equipment, acquire skills, and venture deeper floors.</p>","developers":["MildAcidMale"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997030/b416a868d56e93d9a24311dbdbf8c734147bdd55/header.jpg?t=1760915702","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C)2025 MildAcidMale","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997030/1699610072/dd8240602627597f27a36d7b579f747ba78261c9/1757736138/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758453077","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997030/1699610072/dd8240602627597f27a36d7b579f747ba78261c9/1757736138/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758453077","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997030/1699610072/dd8240602627597f27a36d7b579f747ba78261c9/1757736138/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758453077","id":257197137,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197137/movie480.mp4?t=1758453077","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197137/movie_max.mp4?t=1758453077"},"name":"Trailer_EN","th